eed to make a public contribution, referencing the discussion, stating our current recommendation, using explicit facts, and providing METADATA_JSON with vote.\n\nWe need to incorporate the new info: No explicit attention info for A, decision-quality quick but depth unknown, communication difficulty and egocentric. Also we have other candidates' issues from earlier discussion. We need to argue for or against A, maybe maintain recommendation.\n\nWe should produce a concise argumentative contribution. Let's do: \"I remain leaning towards Candidate A, despite lack of attention data, because his quick correct decisions and calmness outweigh communication concerns, and other candidates have more severe crew cooperation issues.\" Provide evidence: quick correct decisions, calm in crisis, other-oriented attitude, difficulty communicating, egocentric, no attention data. Compare with B, C, D issues.\n\nThus vote Candidate A.\n\nNow produce output."}
